# Proceed Policies

Default: **proceed automatically** when scope is clear. No workflow approval gate.

## Auto-proceed

| Workflow | When |
|----------|------|
| tweak, TDD, verify | scope clear |
| explore, update-docs | target area clear |
| prototype | branch clear |
| implement after approved plan | plan exists |

## Ask before acting

| Workflow | Gate |
|----------|------|
| code-review | report only, no source patches |
| fix | after hypotheses reproduced, before instrumentation/fix |
| feature | phase gates: PRD, slice, issue approval |
| refactor | before candidate selection and implementation |
| triage | before irreversible tracker changes |
| commit-and-document | always before git commit/push |

## Auto-continue chains

After implementation → auto verify → auto review → ask before commit.

Use `Task` subagents for parallel work; pass workflow name and skill path, not slash commands.
